email.task:
You are a project manager at a software company. The new food delivery app is almost finished, and Leo, a junior tester in your team, is going to test it this week. Write an email to Leo explaining what he needs to check, using the notes below. In your email you must use:
- at least two of should, have to and need to;
- at least one passive sentence (… is saved…, … must be reported…);
- be due to or be scheduled to at least once.
Write 80–100 words.
